; The Monolith harness. It is marked (optional) so that plain [dune build] and
; [dune build @runtest] keep working when monolith is not installed: dune then
; silently skips this executable. monolith is therefore NOT a with-test
; dependency of the package (see dune-project / fuzz/README.md).
;
; This executable is intentionally not a test and not attached to @runtest --
; running it means fuzzing (random or afl mode), which is an opt-in activity;
; see fuzz/README.md and fuzz/Makefile.

(executable
 (name main)
 (optional)
 (libraries theo theo_test_support monolith pprint))
